sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant PredSvc as prediction-service<br/>LoadBalancer :80/TCP
    participant PredServer as Prediction Server<br/>:8001/TCP HTTP
    participant LocalFS as Local Model Cache<br/>emptyDir
    participant TrainSvc as training-service<br/>ClusterIP :8000/TCP
    participant TrainServer as Training Server<br/>:8000/TCP HTTP
    participant PVC as training-models-pvc<br/>PersistentVolume

    Note over Client, PVC: Prediction Request Flow

    Client->>PredSvc: POST /predict or /predict/bulk<br/>HTTP, No Auth
    PredSvc->>PredServer: Forward to :8001<br/>TCP
    PredServer->>LocalFS: Load ML models<br/>(XGBoost/LightGBM/BayesianRidge)
    LocalFS-->>PredServer: Model artifacts (joblib)
    PredServer-->>PredSvc: TTFT/TPOT predictions<br/>JSON response
    PredSvc-->>Client: Latency estimates

    Note over PredServer, TrainServer: Model Sync Flow (every 10s)

    PredServer->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/info<br/>Check for newer models
    TrainSvc->>TrainServer: Forward to :8000
    TrainServer->>PVC: Read model metadata
    PVC-->>TrainServer: Model info
    TrainServer-->>TrainSvc: Model version/timestamp
    TrainSvc-->>PredServer: Model info response

    alt New model available
        PredServer->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/download
        TrainSvc->>TrainServer: Forward to :8000
        TrainServer->>PVC: Read model file
        PVC-->>TrainServer: Model artifact (joblib)
        TrainServer-->>TrainSvc: Model binary
        TrainSvc-->>PredServer: Model download
        PredServer->>LocalFS: Validate (joblib.load)<br/>Atomic file replace
    end

    Note over Client, PVC: Training Data Flow

    Client->>TrainSvc: POST /add_training_data_bulk<br/>:8000/TCP HTTP, No Auth
    TrainSvc->>TrainServer: Forward to :8000
    TrainServer->>TrainServer: Train XGBoost +<br/>LightGBM models
    TrainServer->>PVC: Persist trained models

    Note over PredServer, TrainServer: Health Monitoring

    Note right of PredServer: K8s probes:<br/>GET /healthz (liveness)<br/>GET /readyz (readiness)<br/>Returns 503 until models loaded
    Note right of TrainServer: K8s probes:<br/>GET /healthz (liveness)<br/>GET /readyz (readiness)
